{"title":"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 16","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Three numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/b/a5b29b358e825defa3e11b7d903d43ec31e5909a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" />, none zero, form an arithmetic progression. Increasing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or increasing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> results \nin a geometric progression. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> equals:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/b/7fb17a7f6816e1a78938c9fe8fc38bdd6424329b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 16 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 14 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 12 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 10 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"385\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> be the common difference of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Arithmetic_sequence\" title=\"Arithmetic sequence\">arithmetic sequence</a>, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/5/e95df37b37ea8154cdaad70b7991162be6c5a548.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = b-d$\" width=\"73\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/e/c8ef69d23cd707d5b95dbe5390a3943972f7d0ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = b+d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"71\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Since increasing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> results in a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Geometric_sequence\" title=\"Geometric sequence\">geometric sequence</a>,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/b/5eb5c2bfb98135f6887fbca19a14644f198b3f6b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{b}{b-d+1} = \\frac{b+d}{b}\\]\" width=\"138\" height=\"39\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/d/35d1b5cbf28b7052d48f1cc81c75ef840c0b1e13.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{b}{b-d} = \\frac{b+d+2}{b}\\]\" width=\"139\" height=\"37\" />\nCross-multiply in both equations to get a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=System_of_equations\" title=\"System of equations\">system of equations</a>.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/6/bd6cbc64dd988476fbc1d7a7a2cedf03427a8f3b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b^2 = b^2 - d^2 + b + d\\]\" width=\"155\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/3/46319043ef2a485c2ce76c5bf3e54bfdef8e4306.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b^2 = b^2 - d^2 + 2b - 2d\\]\" width=\"173\" height=\"16\" />\nRearranging terms results in\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/a/f7a95f55524474bc3e4731122e47eb1c07975999.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[d^2 = b+d\\]\" width=\"80\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/9/f79f62371bd99f845fd3a11fea958d7ef0cb0c68.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[d^2 = 2b-2d\\]\" width=\"98\" height=\"15\" />\nSubstitute and solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/8/028487290778a35ae0f352df660dfab4510dc429.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b+d = 2b-2d\\]\" width=\"121\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/f/d8ffe0ce956ee1562d7096545982693de6f733ad.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[d = \\frac{b}{3}\\]\" width=\"44\" height=\"37\" />\nFinally, substitute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/b/c5bc74cff8e915c20a122acb60a9cc29ac9cddc2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b \\ne 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"40\" height=\"17\" />, dividing by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is allowed.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/1/8b1ccd8f330bc782e03360bad15c0bceec5d9294.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(\\frac{b}{3})^2 = b + \\frac{b}{3}\\]\" width=\"99\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/d/4bd9fff3d8234c1486e5037dcc4fb7d38d55edf5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{b^2}{9} = \\frac{4b}{3}\\]\" width=\"60\" height=\"39\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/d/4fd3e8e819d6be35ec6564639792e841da9d327a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{b}{9} = \\frac{4}{3}\\]\" width=\"47\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/0/af0ef52abb06063358cab22a99c7a23ddb98e40a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b = 12\\]\" width=\"49\" height=\"12\" />\nThe answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/f/fffc7368e8e7b77c88b0b4bf732c88c60e27b439.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME\" title=\"1963 AHSME\">1963 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1963 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1963\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Prob